/zurich) for the region.\\n\\n### Weather report for Winterthur\\n\\n Until noon a few clouds are expected, and some more clouds roll across in the afternoon. It is a sunny day. Temperature highs are likely to reach 14 °C. Overnight into Saturday light air is noticeable (1 to 7 km/h). By day blows a light breeze (7 to 12 km/h). From time to time gusts could reach up to 26 km/h. Winds blowing overnight from East and by day from Northeast. The weather forecast for Winterthur for Saturday is likely to be accurate.\\n\\n UV 3\\n\\n ▲ 06:24\\n\\n ▼ 18:40\\n\\n ▲ 07:06\\n\\n ▼ 22:13\\n\\n Pressure:\\n 1013 hPa\\n\\n Timezone:\\n CET (UTC +01:00h)\\n\\n The weather forecast has high predictability. Compare different forecasts with [MultiModel](/en/weather/forecast/multimodel/winterthur_switzerland_2657970).\\n\\n Visit the [city climate page](/en/products/cityclimate/zurich) for the region.\\n\\n### Weather report for Winterthur\\n\\n Until noon a few clouds are expected, and some more clouds roll across in the afternoon. It is a sunny day. Temperature highs are likely to reach 14 °C. Overnight into Saturday light air is noticeable (1 to 7 km/h). By day blows a light breeze (7 to 12 km/h). From time to time gusts could reach up to 26 km/h. Winds blowing overnight from East and by day from Northeast. The weather forecast for Winterthur for Saturday is likely to be accurate.\\n\\n UV 3\\n\\n ▲ 06:24\\n\\n ▼ 18:40\\n\\n ▲ 07:06\\n\\n ▼ 22:13\\n\\n Pressure:\\n 1013 hPa\\n\\n Timezone:\\n CET (UTC +01:00h)\\n\\n## Official severe weather warnings\\n\\n Ground frost\\n\\n Moderate weather warning\\n\\n Upcoming\\n\\n From\\n\\n Today 22:00\\n\\n (4 hours from now)\\n\\n Until\\n\\n Tomorrow 08:00\\n\\n (14 hours from now)\\n\\n Bodenfrost\\n\\n Moderate weather warning\\n\\n Upcoming\\n\\n From\\n\\n Today 22:00\\n\\n (4 hours from now)\\n\\n Until\\n\\n Tomorrow 08:00\\n\\n (14 hours from now)\\n\\n Gel au sol\\n\\n Moderate weather warning\\n\\n Upcoming\\n\\n From\\n\\n Today 22:00\\n\\n (4 hours from now)\\n\\n Until\\n\\n Tomorrow 08:00\\n\\n (14 hours from now)\\n\\n Gelata al suolo\\n\\n Moderate weather warning\\n\\n Upcoming\\n\\n From\\n\\n Today 22:00\\n\\n (4 hours from now)\\n\\n Until\\n\\n Tomorrow 08:00\\n\\n (14 hours from now)\\n\\n Schelira dal terren\\n\\n Moderate weather warning\\n\\n Upcoming\\n\\n From\\n\\n Today 22:00\\n\\n (4 hours from now)\\n\\n Until\\n\\n Tomorrow 08:00\\n\\n (14 hours from now)\\n\\n Last update:\\n\\n 7 hours ago\\n\\n Language:\\n\\n## Radar and precipitation nowcast, Switzerland\\n\\n Drizzle\\n\\n Light\\n\\n Moderate\\n\\n Heavy\\n\\n Very Heavy\\n\\n Hail\\n\\n The location marker is placed on Winterthur.\\n This animation shows the precipitation radar for the selected time range, as well as a 2h forecast.\\n Orange crosses indicate lightning. Data provided by [nowcast.de](https://www.nowcast.de) (available in USA, Europe, Australia). Drizzle or light snow fall might be invisible for the radar. Precipitation intensity is colour coded, ranging from turquoise to red.\\n\\n## Hourly weather forecast for Winterthur\\n\\n Our 5-day meteogram for Winterthur offers all weather information in 3 simple graphs:\\n [More]\\n\\n- Temperature chart with weather pictograms. The yellow background indicates daylight.\\n\\n- Clouds in different altitudes: from few clouds (light grey) to overcast (dark grey). Dark blue bars show hourly precipitation and light blue showers. An asterisk indicates snow fall.\\n\\n- Forecasts for wind speeds are blue and for gusts are green. The arrowheads point in the same direction as the wind.\\n\\n You can embed this meteogram into your own website. [Customize it here](/en/weather/widget/setupmeteogram).\\n\\n## Live satellite map, Switzerland\\n\\n The location marker is placed on Winterthur. [More]\\n\\n The real-time satellite image combines visible light during daytime with infrared radiation during nighttime. At night, the image is not dark as infrared radiation can detect temperature differences. Unfortunately, low clouds and fog are difficult to distinguish from ground temperatures and thus can be almost invisible during the night. Meteosat satellite images for Europe are updated in real-time every 5 minutes. GOES-16/GOES-17 (North & South America) and Himawari (Asia) images update every 10 minutes.\\n\\n Precipitation is estimated from radar and satellites. Precipitation estimates from satellites are less accurate at night than during daytime.\\n\\n © 2026 meteoblue, [NOAA Satellites GOES-16](http://www.noaa.gov/) and [EUMETSAT](http://www.eumetsat.int/). Lightning data provided by [nowcast](http://www.nowcast.de/).\\n\\n## Weather for popular places around Winterthur\\n\\n- [Zurich\\n\\n 12 °C /\\n 4 °C](/en/weather/week/zurich_switzerland_2657896)\\n\\n- [St. Gallen\\n\\n 9 °C /\\n 3 °C](/en/weather/week/st.-gallen_switzerland_2658822)\\n\\n- [Schaffhausen\\n\\n 14 °C /\\n 3 °C](/en/weather/week/schaffhausen_switzerland_2658761)\\n\\n- [Winterthur\\n\\n 14 °C /\\n 2 °C](/en/weather/week/winterthur_switzerland_2657970)\\n\\n- [Zug\\n\\n 12 °C /\\n 2 °C](/en/weather/week/zug_switzerland_2657908)\\n\\n- [Frauenfeld\\n\\n 13 °C /\\n 2 °C](/en/weather/week/frauenfeld_switzerland_2660727)\\n\\n- [Aarau\\n\\n 13 °C /\\n 3 °C](/en/weather/week/aarau_switzerland_2661881)\\n\\n- [Herisau\\n\\n 9 °C /\\n 2 °C](/en/weather/week/herisau_switzerland_2660365)\\n\\n- [Schwyz\\n\\n 12 °C /\\n 3 °C](/en/weather/week/schwyz_switzerland_2658665)\\n\\n- [Glarus\\n\\n 12 °C /\\n 2 °C](/en/weather/week/glarus_switzerland_2660594)\\n\\n- [Uster\\n\\n 11 °C /\\n 3 °C](/en/weather/week/uster_switzerland_2658216)\\n\\n- [Horgen\\n\\n 12 °C /\\n 3 °C](/en/weather/week/horgen_switzerland_2660305)\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0fce9319cb463acc\\\">>>\"\n}"}],"details":{"url":"https://www.meteoblue.com/en/weather/week/winterthur_switzerland_2657970","finalUrl":"https://www.meteoblue.com/en/weather/week/winterthur_switzerland_2657970","st